  "note": [
    "The table illustrates the performance of the time targets in months for the administrative courts of appeal, set by the government. The time is measured at the 75th percentile for cases determined during the selected time period (time from filed case to determined case).",
    "The target for Total cases, excluding priority cases and migration cases, is 6 months.",
    "Priority cases must be processed urgently and these are cases according to the Compulsory Psychiatric Care Act (LPT), Forensic Mental Care Act (LRV), Care of Young Persons Act (LVU), and Care of Abusers Act (LVM)."
